            "summary": "The variant converted at 6% against 5%, a lift of 1 percentage point (20% relative). The 95% interval runs from 0.37 to 1.63 points and p = 0.0019, so the lift is statistically significant.",
            "points": [
              {
                "kind": "insight",
                "text": "The whole interval is above zero."
              },
              {
                "kind": "caveat",
                "text": "This assumes one analysis at the planned end."
              }
            ]
          }
